{
  "_id": "portabledoc-showcase",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "fd-001",
      "text": "PortableDoc · the full deck",
      "type": "eyebrow"
    },
    {
      "id": "fd-002",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Every component, on every surface",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "id": "fd-003",
      "items": [
        "One document",
        "Three renderers",
        "Zero screenshots"
      ],
      "type": "byline"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "This paper is a living inventory: every block type PortableDoc ships, rendered live, plus the compositions they unlock. Open it three ways and it is the same document each time — "
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "view"
            }
          ],
          "type": "strong"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " (this reader), "
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "edit"
            }
          ],
          "type": "strong"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " (the Studio canvas, where every block below is directly editable), and "
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "TUI"
            }
          ],
          "type": "strong"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " (the terminal renderer — flip the reader's TUI toggle, or read it over "
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "value": "bp"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": ")."
        }
      ],
      "id": "fd-004",
      "type": "ingress"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Nothing on this page is a picture of a component — each section IS the component, live. Where a surface has a lower ceiling (a terminal cannot play video; a browser does not draw braille charts), the block degrades honestly into a labeled box instead of faking it."
        }
      ],
      "id": "fd-005",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "tone": "info",
      "type": "callout"
    },
    {
      "id": "fd-006",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "fd-007",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "1 · Prose — the elements",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "A paragraph carries every inline mark: "
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "strong"
            }
          ],
          "type": "strong"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": ", "
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "emphasis"
            }
          ],
          "type": "em"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": ", "
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "struck-through"
            }
          ],
          "type": "strike"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": ", inline "
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "value": "code()"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": ", and a "
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "link to the doctrine"
            }
          ],
          "href": "https://guerrilla.barkpark.cloud/papers/composition-doctrine-plan",
          "type": "link"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": ". The same marks survive the trip to the terminal as ANSI styling."
        }
      ],
      "id": "fd-008",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "id": "fd-009",
      "items": [
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "an unordered list — the workhorse"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "with inline marks: "
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "type": "strong"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "code"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "and honest wrapping at every width"
          }
        ]
      ],
      "ordered": false,
      "type": "list"
    },
    {
      "id": "fd-010",
      "items": [
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "ordered when sequence carries meaning"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "measured, then arranged"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "projected onto each surface"
          }
        ]
      ],
      "ordered": true,
      "type": "list"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "The block is the unit of meaning; the surface is just the projection."
        }
      ],
      "id": "fd-011",
      "type": "pullquote"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Callouts carry a tone vocabulary — the same four tones tint cards, notes and grid items everywhere:"
        }
      ],
      "id": "fd-012",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Context worth knowing."
            }
          ],
          "id": "fd-013-0",
          "title": "info",
          "tone": "info",
          "type": "callout"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "The gate is green."
            }
          ],
          "id": "fd-013-1",
          "title": "success",
          "tone": "success",
          "type": "callout"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Mind the ceiling."
            }
          ],
          "id": "fd-013-2",
          "title": "warning",
          "tone": "warning",
          "type": "callout"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Stop before you push."
            }
          ],
          "id": "fd-013-3",
          "title": "danger",
          "tone": "danger",
          "type": "callout"
        }
